@@ -0,0 +1,297 @@
+/**
+ * @file
+ * SNMP server options list
+ */
+
+/*
+ * Copyright (c) 2015 Dirk Ziegelmeier
+ * All rights reserved.
+ *
+ * Redistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without modification,
